  "question": {
    "text": "The compressibility factor for a van der Waal gas at high pressure is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "t7H7U",
      "text": "$1+\\frac{\\mathrm{RT}}{\\mathrm{Pb}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uOf2T",
      "text": "$1+\\frac{\\mathrm{Pb}}{\\mathrm{RT}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "A9a4A",
      "text": "$1-\\frac{\\mathrm{Pb}}{\\mathrm{RT}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NxalN",
      "text": "1",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For 1 mol van der Waal's gas\n$\\left(P+\\frac{a}{V^2}\\right)(v-b)=R T$\nAt high pressure $\\mathrm{P}+\\frac{\\mathrm{a}}{\\mathrm{V}^2} \\approx \\mathrm{P}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\therefore P(V-b)=R T \\\\ & \\therefore P V-P b=R T \\\\ & P V=R T+P b \\\\ & z=\\frac{P V}{R T}=\\frac{R T}{R T}+\\frac{P b}{R T} \\\\ & \\therefore z=1+\\frac{P b}{R T}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
